  "contract": [
    "Capture the period at descriptor+76. On unsigned sequence modulo period zero, clear the live sum buffer for wrapped channel_count*24 bytes, clear24 summary bytes, then reset three vector sums. Actual native/C clear helpers execute.",
    "Reload live channel counts and pointers. Add only float lanes8/12/16/20 per24-byte record, preserving first-color lanes0/4. Preserve accumulator-first NaN selection using an ordinary noinline C add helper under the recorded profile. Reload the source/destination between the two color pairs.",
    "Add three metadata words with unsigned32 wrap. Completion uses the reloaded sequence and unsigned period arithmetic; incomplete windows return3. Completion copies the low record-count byte and stores the unsigned window index.",
    "On completion divide four lanes by signed32-period-to-float32, combine lanes8 and16 into the compact summary, then divide by the live unsigned channel count. Preserve live count and summary-pointer reloads across stores. Divide the three wrapped metadata sums as signed32 with truncation toward zero.",
    "Explicit unsigned magnitude arithmetic avoids C signed-overflow/zero-division undefined behavior. It matches observed SDIV/UDIV results including INT_MIN/-1 and zero denominators with division trapping disabled. No inline assembly, new state or added import is introduced."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "2422 scenario pairs comprise2020 direct and402 frame cases. The direct scenarios include72 two-window lifecycles and3364 actual batch calls; with frame calls the fixtures compare3766 native/C invocations. Some frame cases gate before batch. Both fixtures execute all490 new native instruction bytes.",
    "Direct scenarios use actual C/native clear helpers and no algorithm/math mocks. Finite cases use independent rational arithmetic/control oracles; exceptional cases compare NaN payloads, all rounding/FZ/DN combinations, full active FPSCR, selected aliases and four matching faults. Per-call lifecycle boundary hashes and final public RAM bytes match; saved registers, stack and masks agree.",
    "Frame integration executes the real frame, core, assembler, parity, decoder, batch and polynomial code. Twelve later stages and allocator/free ports remain modeled. This is not a complete computation engine, real allocator lifecycle, physical sampling or bootable image.",
    "The emulator/default nontrapping integer division setting is part of the tested contract. Enabled DIV_0_TRP behavior, physical interrupt/concurrency timing, cold FPU, arbitrary private aliases and final source startup/placement remain unverified. NaN operand order is tied to the recorded compiled object/profile and must be rechecked when changing compilers.",
    "904 units compile/compose without failures or duplicate strong symbols;893 prior nongenerated source/object pairs and source-plan/cache files remain unchanged. Batch import removed with no added imports, leaving89 application/22 boot. Relocatable composition is not a bootable image."
  ],
